cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HERALD"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Saporito
    given-names: Aaron
  - family-names: Guerra
    given-names: Sophia
repository-code: "https://github.com/sophiaguerra/HERALD"
abstract: >-
  HERALD identifies reads that may span a horizontal gene transfer junction by
  fragmenting poorly-aligned reads, realigning the fragments, and reporting
  reads whose fragments map contiguously to more than one genome.
license: MPL-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
references:
  - type: software
    title: minimap2
    version: "2.30-r1287"
    notes: >-
      Aligner used for the realignment step in the reported results. HERALD is
      aligner-agnostic, but results depend on the aligner and its settings.
